      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Emoji Refactored is a 4-reel, 4-row video slot with 32 paylines and bets
    ranging from 1 to 90.


    The value in the bottom left corner displays the
    available money for betting.


    The "Auto Spin" feature automatically plays
    for the selected number of spins.


    Winning combinations and payouts are
    determined according to the "Paytable."


    The line bet win is equal to the
    amount shown in the "Paytable," multiplied by the selected bet.


    Only the
    highest win per payline is paid.


    Wins are awarded on paylines if the winning
    symbols occur consecutively from the leftmost reel.


    Simultaneous wins on
    different paylines are added together.


    All winnings are presented in cash.


    The
    Wild symbol substitutes for all symbols.'
