  m_text: 'Play

    Tap to start playing with the current bet setting.

    Tap
    the button again during regular play to stop the reels.



    Stop

    Tap
    to stop Auto Spin. The number on the button indicates the remaining number of
    Auto Spins.



    Minus

    Tap to decrease the current bet value.


    Plus

    Tap
    to increase the current bet value.



    Auto Spin

    Tap to open the Auto
    Spin panel.

    Tap on the values to select the number of Auto Spins.



    Turbo
    Spin

    Tap to activate or deactivate Turbo Spin, which will reduce the duration
    of the reel spins in the main game.



    Settings

    Tap to open the settings
    panel.'
